(30, 1, 1, 'Pilot', 'Best friends Debbie and Judith are forced on the run when Debbie discovers Judith isn''t a forensic accountant, she''s an international assassin! With a mysterious figure chasing them, and Debbie''s husband involved in something deeply corrupt, it''s a race against time and a road trip across Europe to untangle the truth and stay alive.', 2208, 'assets/backdrops/tv_241882.jpg'),
