(53, 1, 1, 'The Long Road', 'David Letterman uses mature humor to appeal to his audience in this weeknight series, which gets its music from a house band led by Paul Shaffer. Among the show''s most-famous segments are the Top Ten List and Stupid Pet Tricks, the latter of which subsequently led to an additional recurring segment called Stupid Human Tricks.', 2507, 'assets/backdrops/tv_498.jpg'),
