(54, 1, 1, 'The Counterfeit', 'The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson is a talk show hosted by Johnny Carson under The Tonight Show franchise from 1962 to 1992. It originally aired during late-night. For its first ten years, Carson''s Tonight Show was based in New York City with occasional trips to Burbank, California; in May 1972, the show moved permanently to Burbank, California. In 2002, The Tonight Show Starring Johnny Carson was ranked #12 on TV Guide''s 50 Greatest TV Shows of All Time.', 2520, 'assets/backdrops/tv_2261.jpg'),
